  "seoTitle": "President Prabowo Awards 19 National Hero Titles",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto conferred the National Hero title upon 19 individuals, including military leaders and religious scholars, during Hero's Day.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto officially granted the title of National Hero to 19 distinguished figures during the commemoration of Hero's Day.",
    "The recipients include notable individuals such as guerilla commander Lieutenant Colonel Mochamad Sroedji, Kiai Haji Abbas Abdul Jamil, and Sultan Ibrahim Chaliludin.",
    "Government officials noted that these honors serve to inspire youth and recognize significant contributions to the nation’s history and independence."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "In observance of the annual Hero's Day, President Prabowo Subianto presided over an official ceremony at the State Palace to confer the prestigious title of National Hero upon 19 figures. The list of honorees comprises a diverse group of historical contributors, including military leaders, religious scholars, and regional traditional figures who played significant roles in the nation's development. Notable recipients include Lieutenant Colonel (Posthumous) Mochamad Sroedji, the former commander of Brigade III Damarwulan, as well as Kiai Haji Abbas Abdul Jamil, a prominent ulama and founder of Pondok Pesantren Buntet in Cirebon. Additionally, the list includes Sultan Ibrahim Chaliludin, recognized for his leadership in the Paser War. The selection process involved formal nominations, with some officials noting that prior discussions occurred regarding specific candidates, including historical figures from Central Java and Banten, to ensure recognition of their legacies.",
